version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-03-13
abstract: >
  An integrated open-source Security Operations Centre (SOC) framework combining
  Zeek (behaviour-based network depth inspection), Suricata (signature-based IDS),
  and Wazuh (HIDS/SIEM) with a dual-model machine learning pipeline (Random Forest
  and LSTM autoencoder) for false positive reduction, MITRE ATT&CK-mapped detection,
  and automated active response. Developed as part of Hybrid Master's research at
  Whitecliffe, Aotearoa New Zealand.
